        <span itemprop="subject">“Exemplary” or “for example”</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">means “an example of” and is not intended to convey an indication of a preferred or ideal embodiment. Similarly, “such as” is not used in a restrictive sense, but for explanatory or exemplary purposes.</span>
